    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Establishing a petrochemical complex project in Jubail Industrial City (2) to produce 1.15 mtpa of ethylene, 850,000 tpa of propylene and 400,000 tpa of aromatics, fuels and their derivatives, using crackers, and the most efficient technologies, in energy and feedstock consumption.</p>\r\n",
